   "t": "Я сейчас скажу, вам принесут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will ask them to bring some.' Thinking it is ordinary tea, Igor offers to have the staff bring Viktor a fresh pot.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "igor",
   "t": "Шеф, еще чаек.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Boss, more tea.' Igor happily calls out for more of his special 'tea'.",
