  },
  {
   "v": "igor",
   "t": "Поражаюсь вам, Виктор Петрович.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I have to hand it to you, Viktor Petrovich.' Igor says he is amazed by how smoothly Viktor runs the kitchen even while sitting down.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "igor",
   "t": "Как у вас все схвачено.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You have got everything under control.' He remarks that Viktor seems to have the whole kitchen under control.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "igor",
   "t": "Стоило только подумать, вот пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You only had to think of it, and there it was.' Another teapot appears the moment Viktor asks, impressing Igor.",
